"CO2 sequestration in ultramafic tailings"			

! This model includes  

! 

! 1) cover

! 2) rainfall events

!Trying to reproduce Massmann and Farrier (1992) paper

! Section 1: global control parameters                                      			

! --------------------------------------------------------------------------			

!   			

'global control parameters'                                                 			

'preconditioning - wetland Leuna A2'                                        			

.true.                        ;varsat_flow                                  			

.true.                       ;steady_flow                                  			

.false.                       ;fully_saturated                              			

.true.                        ;reactive_transport                           			

.false.                       ;plant_uptake and physical evaporation	





!'density dependent flow'



!'energy balance' 

			

!'restart' 



'done'                                                                      			

!   			

! Section 2: geochemical system                                             			

! --------------------------------------------------------------------------			

!   			

'geochemical system'			

			

'use new database format'



'use pitzer model'



'use macinnes convention' 

			

'database directory'                                                        

'databaseAH'                                          			

			                                                                    			

			

'define temperature'			

25			

			

			

'components'                                                                			

5                               ;number of components (nc-1)                			

'cl-1'

'na+1'

'h+1'

'n2(aq)'

'h4sio4'



'secondary aqueous species'                                                 			

1                 ;number of secondary aqueous species

'oh-' 





			

'gases'                                                                     			

1                             ;number of gases			

'n2(g)'

			

'minerals'                                                                  			

1            ;number of minerals	

'quartz'

			

			

'done'                                                                      			

